    AUTO SERVER HOP SCRIPT v13.1 (AFK Threshold Edition — Reviewed)
    - Highest: first Desc server with >= MIN_FREE_SLOTS free slots.
    - Lowest:  absolute emptiest server with >= 1 free slot.
    - Force:   first joinable server.
    - AFK threshold: hop out when AFK count reaches setting.
    - UI shows live AFK count when AFK Watch is on.
]]

